  "gotchas": [
    "This is a second step, only for networks that require a customer-side confirmation after the initial push (e.g. Wizall Senegal, Coris Benin). On other networks it returns 400.",
    "A failed confirmation returns a deliberately generic 422 message: never expect the gateway's reason in it.",
    "409 means the transaction cannot be confirmed in its current state (not_pending, no_gateway, no_attempt): check it with verify_payment instead of retrying the OTP."
  ],
